bular hair cells are connected to accessory structures in such a way that movements of the head displace their stereocilia. This influences the membrane potential of the cells which relay information about movements via the vestibular part of the vestibulocochlear nerve to the brain stem.\")\n9126:EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_0000622 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000150 obo:CL_0000154 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0009842)))\n9172:EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_0000626 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000120 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_0005378)))\n9230:EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_0000632 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0002320 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0002107) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002104 obo:PR_000007939)))\n9237:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"GOC:tfm\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"ISBN:0721662544\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000633 \"A tall supporting cell that is arranged in rows adjacent to the last row of outer phalangeal cells. This cell type constitutes the outer border of the organ of Corti.\")\n9273:SubClassOf(obo:CL_0000636 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0000966))\n9280:EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_0000637 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000166 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0002196)))\n9294:SubClassOf(obo:CL_0000638 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0006964))\n9331:SubClassOf(obo:CL_0000642 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0002196))\n9348:SubClassOf(obo:CL_0000644 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0002979))\n9357:SubClassOf(obo:CL_0000645 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0002198))\n9394:EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_0000648 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000151 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0002113) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0002001)))\n9396:SubClassOf(obo:CL_0000648 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0002303))\n9405:EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_0000649 ObjectIntersect