oi:10.1016/j.cub.2021.10.015\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4030051 \"A DRD1-expressing medium spiny neuron that is part of a nucleus accumbens shell or olfactory tubercle.\")\n32098:SubClassOf(obo:CL_4030051 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_0005403))\n32103:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"doi:10.1016/j.cub.2021.10.015\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4030052 \"A DRD2-expressing medium spiny neuron that is part of a nucleus accumbens shell or olfactory tubercle.\")\n32112:SubClassOf(obo:CL_4030052 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_0005403))\n32125:SubClassOf(obo:CL_4030053 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:UBERON_0001881 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0005403))))\n32131:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34727523\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4030054 \"A DRD1-expressing medium spiny neuron that is part of dense, RXFP1-positive cell islands throughout the nucleus accumbens, putamen, and near the adjacent septal nuclei.\")\n32138:SubClassOf(obo:CL_4030054 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_0005403))\n32144:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"doi:10.1038/s41385-022-00565-0\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4030055 \"A urothelial cell that is part of the regenerative layer(s) of cells directly superficial to basal cells in urothelium. The layer of intermediate cells in the urothelium ranges from one to several layers thick depending on the species with intermediate cells attached to adjacent cell layers and one another via desmosomes.\")\n32155:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"doi:10.1038/s41385-022-00565-0\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4030056 \"A urothelial cell that is terminally differentiated and part of the urothelial apical surface that forms the high-resistance barrier of urothelium. Umbrella cells have been described as the largest of urothelial cell types, highly polarized, and, in some species, multinucleated. In the relaxed stat